{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22429","headline":"南湖晚秋 · 白居易","name":"南湖晚秋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"八月白露降，湖中水方老。\n旦夕秋风多，衰荷半倾倒。\n手攀青枫树，足蹋黄芦草。\n惨澹老容颜，冷落秋怀抱。\n有兄在淮楚，有弟在蜀道。\n万里何时来，烟波白浩浩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22429.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22429","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}